#. ~ Description of "Hub 01 soldier helmet"
#: data/json/items/armor/robofac_armor.json
msgid ""
"3D printed armor for the head, sporting a professional finish and stellar "
"ergonomics.  Composed of a dense metal shell sandwiched between layers of "
"composite-grade aramid fabric, it provides excellent protection, ensuring "
"you'll keep your head against whatever the Cataclysm throws at you.  Designed"
" to clip to some kind of attachment point, its interior reads \"ATTACH TO "
"MODULAR HEADGEAR\"."
msgstr ""

